{"name":"Disguise","hex":"#b7b698","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"disguise","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Material (such as clothing, makeup, a wig) used to alter one’s visual appearance in order to hide one's identity or assume another.","The appearance of something on the outside which masks what’s beneath."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To change the appearance of (a person or thing) so as to hide, or to assume an identity.","To transform or disfigure, to change the appearance of in general."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/disguise"}],"entries":[{"title":"Disguise","blocks":[{"text":"A disguise can be anything incognito which conceals one's identity or changes a person's physical appearance, including a wig, glasses, makeup, fake moustache, costume or other items. Camouflage is a type of disguise for people, animals and objects. Hats, glasses, changes in hair style or wigs, plastic surgery, and make-up are also used."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Tie_Disguise.JPEG/330px-Tie_Disguise.JPEG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disguise"},{"title":"Disguise (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Disguise is the fifth studio album by American metalcore band Motionless in White. It was released on June 7, 2019, through Roadrunner Records and was produced by Drew Fulk and Chris \"Motionless\" Cerulli. It is the second release on a major label since the band's departure from Fearless Records. The album's tracklist was revealed on April 17 together with the release of the two singles, \"Disguise\", which had been premiered at Earthday Birthday in Orlando a few days prior, and \"Brand New Numb\". It is the band's first album to credit Vinny Mauro on drums, as well as the first album not to feature Josh Balz on keyboards."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b1/DisguiseMIWcover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disguise_(album)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/Maglite_zip_gun.jpg/250px-Maglite_zip_gun.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/Maglite_zip_gun.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/Maglite_zip_gun.jpg/250px-Maglite_zip_gun.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A gun disguised as a maglite","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMaglite_zip_gun.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Hitlerwithoutmoustache0002.jpg/500px-Hitlerwithoutmoustache0002.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Hitlerwithoutmoustache0002.jpg/1280px-Hitlerwithoutmoustache0002.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Hitlerwithoutmoustache0002.jpg/500px-Hitlerwithoutmoustache0002.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Adolf Hitler depicted in possible disguises by the United States Secret Service in 1944","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHitlerwithoutmoustache0002.jpg"}],"sounds":{"disguise":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/En-us-disguise.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bc/En-us-disguise.ogg/En-us-disguise.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Grey bucchero-ware bowl, Clay, 1000-700 BCE, Nr. Babakõy, Turkey, Fitzwilliam Museum, C